+---
+description: "记录持久化类型更改及其兼容性确认。"
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage
+
+[English](2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage.md) | 中文
+
+## 概述
+
+读取器支持 DSHU v4 记录的 memory/extraction 事件，以及 memory-context 和 memory-extraction 消息来源。
+
+## 目录
+
+- [声明](#declaration)
+- [兼容性](#compatibility)
+- [验证](#verification)
+- [开发备注](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## 声明
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-11-24-z-released-memory-usage
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "426eaa9b7e514edfdce64afc01437bb6b22fee7d59499f2f64d32ed2ea701985"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "b3677b36e945db16dc2ffc8cea0ee1c53f5f6d6fd7b237c6c1bf743da2c20613"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:memory/extraction"
+    previous: null
+    after: "153bbdf973e2e101975b37c2c9a35ad1e26402e7981854f810d937ad348383e6"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "41fff1282d7a7885b5ce83a7da921cea4fc54f11e9c9d43517c264993a4c4b2e"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-11-24-writing-spending-sources"
+    after: "8735b024d34a622b2e56d90b63c4109af57b7590d6f78bb943b5c3f9b227c2c2"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## 兼容性
+
+辅助事件没有主对话消息操作。已有 DSHU 日志保留原有消息和请求标识。读取器接受已记录的请求和结果，读取过程不产生新事件。较早的上游读取器会拒绝这个必读事件。会话沿用 v4 格式。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## 验证
+
+跨版本验收用正式版 DSHU 源码写入压缩会话，再用候选版两次打开资料副本，逐条比较主对话消息，并根据记录的模型用量核对辅助费用。会话读取器也检查无法识别的必读事件。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## 开发备注
+
+无。
