+| Ch | POV | Goal | Obstacle | Turn | Ends on | Words | Threads |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+
+## Subplots
+| ID | Thread | Theme question it varies | Payoff |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+
+## Set pieces
+1.
+2.
+3.
+
