+- Which thread is most likely to be dropped:
+```
+
+## Word budget
+
+| Length | Chapters | Words/chapter | Total |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Novella | 8–12 | 3,000–4,000 | 25k–45k |
+| Commercial novel | 20–35 | 3,000–4,500 | 70k–110k |
+| Epic fantasy | 35–60 | 4,000–6,000 | 140k–250k |
